<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: ADVISORY- Prague bourse technical problems persist.</title>
<headline>ADVISORY- Prague bourse technical problems persist.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Price quotations from the Prague Stock Exchange (PSE) have been delayed on Thursday because of a technical problem affecting the distribution of data from the Exchange to Reuters.</p>
<p>The Exchange says it is working on the problem but cannot say when repairs will be completed.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
